.git
**/node_modules

# Build output. These are gitignored, so whatever stale copy happens to sit in
# the local working tree would otherwise be copied into the build context by
# `COPY packages ./packages` / `COPY app ./app` and shipped as-is. Everything
# here is rebuilt inside the image, so it must never be inherited from the host.
**/dist
**/build
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local-storage uploads. Gitignored, so its contents differ per checkout — a
# fresh clone/worktree/CI has none, a long-lived checkout has stale extras. The
# builder repopulates it from the tracked `app/seed-assets/` instead (see
# scripts/mirror-seed-assets.mjs), keeping the image reproducible from git.
app/uploads

.rebase-dev-port
.rebase/
.rebase-dev-url
scratch
test-cli-init-project

# Prevent secrets from being copied into Docker images
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.artifacts
